WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:08.080
High balls are usually met at chest or shoulder height or above.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:15.428
That means the backswing has to be high: not just the racket,

00:00:15.428 --> 00:00:21.210
your whole body has to rise up and stretch tall.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:31.148
The rhythm for high balls is: set high, load, and drive, driving your weight forward.

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:34.970
That last part is crucial for power on high balls.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:40.290
Make sure your chest faces forward as you drive your weight forward; don't lean over and press down on the ball.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.500 line:10%
Common mistake

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.630
This is driving forward; this is pressing down.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:52.030
Once you have these details, we put them into the forehand and backhand framework and practise each with the ball machine.
